{
  "dom_id": "step-e6931",
  "name": "Example: Factoring a Trinomial With a Negative Quadratic Term",
  "problem": "Factor the expression $-2x^2-22x-48.$",
  "worked_solution": "First, notice that we can factor out a $-2$ from each of the terms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}^{2}-22x-48 & = \\\\ -2({x}^{2}+11x+24)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we just need to factor the polynomial $x^2+11x+24$ in parentheses.\n\nFirst, we find the factor pairs of the constant term $(24)\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(1,24),\\,(2,12),\\,(3,8),\\,(4,6)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we find which factor pair adds up to the coefficient of the linear term $(11)\\mathbin{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1+24 & =25 & \\times  \\\\ 2+12 & =14 & \\times  \\\\ 3+8 & =11 & ✓ \\\\ 4+6 & =10 & \\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nUsing the factor pair identified in the previous step, write the linear term as $11x=3x+8x,$ and then factor the expression completely:\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n-2\\left(x^2+11x+24\\right)&=\\[5pt]\n-2\\left(x^2+3x+8x+24\\right)&=\\[5pt]\n-2\\left((x^2+3x)+(8x+24)\\right)&=\\[5pt]\n-2\\Bigl(x(x+3)+8(x+3)\\Bigr)&=\\[5pt]\n-2(x+8)(x+3)\n\t}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e6931\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Factoring a Trinomial With a Negative Quadratic Term</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e6931\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n            